nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NGjGnCy7PgMQ7kNvwEEDoJX&_nc_oc=AdrqzNyZo04Vv8uNb06ijkxBxKimHG62-EwpSjhpfZXghlv1XUaAqv8N9L0j1tBTNmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRv6WdRDh9rtuhzcvC8xn0g9eUOvdSqI10FjTvKNCGUtg&oe=6AEDE698"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5_lotus_and_vow.png", "id": "1398864782190420", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620316_1398864785523753_8023386678578750478_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7hU9vJDkbAkQ7kNvwFArhfR&_nc_oc=Adpzw4T-MuJnaOl2car8MFWSQcFdwegUtszJQiovCbW2Hxlsg42sUtPtI8S7-7qV1Tk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTzOsceOJ4wI7kU36N269ybRJZ0f8yRWnBaBBR6tVMgiw&oe=6AEDEE24"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1097027546186229", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593718973_1097027552852895_2914204180715256591_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g1UTucu0aXoQ7kNvwFFy7vQ&_nc_oc=AdpEbMaHoWL4GXYwilzXIROAHOXTYMgmSpbgZf-q4TiH1iOhLtf0t-Ehbu5qN0sQuMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTbENhIfETjWPCZvJ6kLz1vsweuxmwOv-yQDxSYb3541w&oe=6AEDDD3C"}, "display_name": "UNDERPASS 666 - Cyberpunk \u4e07\u706f\u4f1a", "keywords": ["rhythm", "horror", "lantern", "shooter", "cyberpunk"], "long_description": "Route 666 was closed long ago. The tunnel under it was never filled in.\n\nYou walk. You cannot stop, and you cannot turn back.\nAbove the entrance, cut into the concrete, is a line from Dante.\n\nStone lanterns stand along both walls, unlit.\nPale lights drift between them. Shoot one.\nIt becomes a sound, and a lantern is lit.\nEach lantern sounds one note of Clair de lune.\nThe melody exists only while you are firing.\n\nWhen the melody ends, the walking slows.\nTen figures are standing in the dark.\nOne of them has different eyes.\n\nA festival of ten thousand lamps, held underground, for no one.", "short_description": "The tunnel is 104 metres long, and then it begins again.\n\nShoot the drifting lights.\nEach one becomes a sound, and a lantern is lit."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "929071953154238", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "UNDERPASS 666 - Cyberpunk \u4e07\u706f\u4f1a", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u516d\u516d\u516d\u53f7\u7dda\u306f\u3068\u3046\u306b\u5ec3\u3055\u308c\u305f\u3002\u305d\u306e\u4e0b\u306e\u5730\u4e0b\u9053\u306f\u3001\u57cb\u3081\u3089\u308c\u306a\u3044\u307e\u307e\u6b8b\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\n\n\u6b69\u304f\u3002\u6b62\u307e\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3002\u5f15\u304d\u8fd4\u305b\u306a\u3044\u3002\n\u5165\u53e3\u306e\u4e0a\u3001\u30b3\u30f3\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u5f6b\u3089\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u306f\u30c0\u30f3\u30c6\u306e\u4e00\u884c\u3002\n\n\u4e21\u5074\u306e\u58c1\u306b\u77f3\u706f\u7c60\u304c\u4e26\u3073\u3001\u3069\u308c\u3082\u706f\u3063\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u3002\n\u305d\u306e\u9593\u3092\u9752\u767d\u3044\u706b\u304c\u6f02\u3046\u3002\u6483\u3064\u3002\n\u97f3\u306b\u306a\u308a\u3001\u706f\u304c\u3068\u3082\u308b\u3002\n\u706f\u7c60\u306f\u3072\u3068\u3064\u305a\u3064\u300c\u6708\u306e\u5149\u300d\u3092\u4e00\u97f3\u9cf4\u3089\u3059\u3002\n\u65cb\u5f8b\u306f\u3001\u6483\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3042\u3044\u3060\u3060\u3051\u5b58\u5728\u3059\u308b\u3002\n\n\u65cb\u5f8b\u304c\u7d42\u308f\u308b\u3068\u3001\u6b69\u307f\u304c\u9045\u304f\u306a\u308b\u3002\n\u95c7\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u5341\u306e\u5f71\u304c\u7acb\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\n\u3072\u3068\u3064\u3060\u3051\u3001\u76ee\u306e\u8272\u304c\u9055\u3046\u3002\n\n\u5730\u4e0b\u3067\u3001\u8ab0\u306e\u305f\u3081\u3067\u3082\u306a\u304f\u884c\u308f\u308c\u308b\u3001\u4e07\u706f\u4f1a\u3002", "short_description": "\u3053\u306e\u5730\u4e0b\u9053\u306f\u767e\u56db\u30e1\u30fc\u30c8\u30eb\u3067\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u307e\u305f\u59cb\u307e\u308b\u3002\n\n\u6f02\u3046\u706